# 流式（SSE）：响应为 text/event-stream，事件依次为 session → delta / tool_call / tool_result → done 或 error
POST {{CesiumAI.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "清空当前场景",
  "sessionId": null,
  "sceneSummary": {
    "entities": []
  },
  "relevantPackets": []
}
